--[[
    Violence District — Survivor Perks Reference
    Source: VD Discord + Wealthy District Wiki, patches through Nov 7 2026

    45 survivor perks. Tiers shown as T1/T2/T3.

    Nov 7: aura perks no longer target chained survivors.
    Affected: Break Free, Nobody Left Behind, Absolute Confidence,
              Bounce Back, Familiar Soul.


    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    WINDED PERKS  (speed boosts that apply Winded cooldown)
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    Break Free [Halloween]
        Injured fast vault → hide bloodstains 3/4/5s. 40s CD.
        Escape chase → killer aura + all survivor auras 6s + 10% speed.
        Applies Winded 30s. Can't trigger while Winded.

    Evasive Manoeuvre [Halloween]
        Vault any window/pallet → activates 15s.
        Next vault: 5/10/15% faster + 15% speed 4/5/6s.
        Applies Winded 40s.

    Great Collapse
        Stun killer w/ pallet → 20/30/30% speed 2/2/3s.
        Not while Winded. Applies Winded 40s.

    Heads Up
        Killer within 50 studs → sound + killer aura + 10/15/20% speed 3s.
        Not while Winded. Applies Winded 40s.
        Nov 7: can't activate during chase.

    Perfect Landing
        Fall from height → 75% faster recovery + 40% speed 3s.
        Not while Winded. Applies Winded 60/50/40s.

    Quick Recovery
        Fast/medium vault window → 40% speed 3s.
        Not while Winded. Applies Winded 70/60/50s.


    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    CHASE PERKS  (movement/speed, no Winded)
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    Hyperactive [Halloween]
        Walk 10/15/20% faster (not crouching/sprinting).
        Winded recovery 5/10/15% faster.
        Other negative effects 10/15/20% faster recovery.

    Left Behind
        Gates powered → 5/6/7% speed.

    No Way Back [Halloween]
        Window blocked within 40/50/60 studs → 7% speed 4s + killer aura.
        60s CD.

    Time To Grow Up
        Extends hit speed boost by 1/2/3s.

    We're Stronger Together
        Within 15 studs of survivor → all in range get 4/5/6% speed.

    Snake Step
        Crouched: block killer aura reads (60s CD).
        Crouch speed +80/90/100%.


    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    HEALING PERKS
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    Against All Odds
        Heal dying survivor 50/60/70% faster + killer aura revealed.

    Ambitious Medic
        Injured great skill check → recover 2 healing charges (sound cue).
        +40% skill check trigger chance.
        Both using this perk → healing checks 40% slower.

    Born In Blood
        Finish healing another → both get 10/20/30% speed 6s.

    Enhanced Touch
        Finish healing another → healed gets +10% heal/repair speed
        + 5% move speed 20/25/30s.

    Expensive Decor
        Others heal you 30/40/50% faster.
        Each chain: half replaced by additive +10%.

    Nobody Left Behind
        Gates powered → all survivor auras + 55/65/75% heal/unspike speed.
        No longer targets chained (Nov 7).

    Pacifist
        +20% healing speed. Additional +5/7/10% per survivor missing from 5.


    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    SURVIVAL PERKS  (hook/dying/endurance)
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    Built Different
        Heal from dying → Endurance 6/7/8s.
        Can self-pickup once per round.

    Desperate
        Picked up by killer → instantly 10/15/20% wiggle progress.

    High Karma
        After unspiking, activates. First spike: self-unspike.
        Self-unspike → Anti-Heal 110/95/80s.

    Intense Workout
        Unspike 40/45/50% faster + 10% speed 8s.

    Iron Tranquility
        On spike: aura hidden from killer. Blood pools -3/4/5s lifetime.

    Last Stand
        Gates powered → heal 1 state + killer aura 10/15/20s.

    No Pain No Gain
        Permanently injured. Self-recover from dying. No blood pools.
        +20/25/30% self-recovery speed.

    Perseverance [Halloween]
        Injured: +5% repair, +10% all other actions.
        Recover survivor from ground while injured → Invulnerability 6/8/10s.

    Second Wind
        After unspiked: Endurance extended 15/20/25s.


    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    AURA / INFO PERKS
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    Absolute Confidence
        In chase: survivors within 180 studs get 3/5/7% action speed + aura to you.
        No longer targets chained (Nov 7).

    Call Me Back
        Healed survivor hit → their aura 20/30/40s.
        Nov 7: hit survivor also sees YOUR aura.

    Debut Showcase
        Parry/stun/blind killer → killer aura to ALL survivors 3/4/5s.

    Eyes Of Heaven
        Pallet and window auras within 80/90/100 studs.

    Familiar Soul
        Survivor auras within 80/100/120 studs.
        No longer targets chained (Nov 7).

    Hearing Aid
        Killer breaks pallet or kicks gen within 240 studs → killer aura 4/5/6s.

    On My Own
        Last alive → killer aura 10s + 40/50/60% gate speed.

    Onscreen Fear [Halloween]
        In TR, not in chase: +1/2/3% speed, +5/8/10% heal/repair.

    Visual Learner
        Start 1 token. Gen done = +1. Fast vault: consume 1 → killer aura 3/4/5s (150 studs).
        25s CD. +2s all aura reads.


    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    REPAIR PERKS
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    Flawless Execution
        Solo gen, consecutive great checks: +3/4/5% per check (resets on miss).
        After 3rd: additional +1/2/3%. Each check shortens next by 0.05/0.075/0.1s.
        8/10/12s window to return.

    Group Project
        +3/5/7% repair per survivor on same gen. Shared.
        Doesn't stack w/ itself.

    Partners In Crime
        Both in TR 15s (not chase) → 1 token (max 3). Each = 2/3/4% repair.
        -1 token per 25s not repairing. -1 on chase start.

    Perfectionist Planning
        3 closest unrepaired gen auras. +10% repair on them.
        Repairing reveals their aura to others 35/45/55s. -5% on other gens.


    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    UTILITY PERKS
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    Abrasive [Halloween]
        Hit by killer → killer aura to ALL survivors 6/8/10s + 20/30/40% slow 2.5s.
        If hit while Invulnerable: slow doubled (5s).
        Not while Winded.

    Bounce Back [Halloween]
        Freed from chain → all gen, killer, survivor auras 20/25/30s + 7% speed.
        No longer targets chained (Nov 7).

    Carpenter [Halloween]
        Pallet dropped → killer aura 2s (20s CD).
        See dropped pallet auras.
        Recover dropped pallets by crouching near 5/4/3s.

    Flowstate
        Fast vault → 20% quicker w/ special animation. CD: 70/60/50s.


    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    EXPLOIT NOTES
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    - Winded is the key speed limiter — track per-survivor for cooldown awareness
    - Break Free + Evasive Manoeuvre are meta Winded perks (Halloween)
    - Heads Up no longer in chase — less useful for killer baiting
    - Carpenter recovers dropped pallets — pallet count not strictly decreasing
    - Bounce Back: 30s full map awareness on unhook — massive info dump
    - Abrasive team-wide killer aura on hit = strongest anti-stealth
    - Snake Step aura block + crouch speed = counter to aura-read builds
    - Perseverance Invulnerability on pickup punishes slugging
    - Visual Learner +2s affects every other aura perk in build
    - Onscreen Fear rewards staying in TR — counter-intuitive gen rush
    - Ambitious Medic great checks are server-validated
    - Flawless Execution stacking speed + shortening checks trackable client-side
    - Partners In Crime tokens accumulate passively — know when max for gen rush
    - High Karma Anti-Heal at T1 (110s) is longest in game
]]

